[sliver] The mirrored end lands belong to the fore-facing flavour-valve tray. Its wall-to-wall plate is 10 mm deep at y=167.560..177.560 and is trimmed to front-top's established 45-degree flank bedding. These faces expose the solid plate-to-flank root and carry the full tray depth.
