click: x=0.000 y=91.744 z=289.095

[ceiling] The pump jack's receptacle roof and upper snap catch — square engagement faces for the module's tang and latch, inside the boss that stands on the plate cap's crown behind the ridge wall. The 14.9 mm roof bridges the boss's two side walls, the same span back-top's receptacle prints.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/enclosure/enclosure-front-top.step
