[ceiling] Upper sliding face of the rectangular carrier guide. It spans the opening and locates the handhold throughout its Y stroke, with 0.15 mm running clearance above the body. Removable support is accessible through the flank opening.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/enclosure/enclosure-front-top.step
