click: x=106.000 y=116.543 z=223.395

[ceiling] Flat ceiling of the internal grip recess. It carries the hidden retaining rim with 0.15 mm running clearance and continues to the aft valve tray's fore plane for inside-out loading. The enclosing stock keeps a broad, continuous section above the rim; support is removed through the open internal recess before hardware installation. The current production slice records both contact regions in the support ledger.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/enclosure/enclosure-front-top.step
